Package: com.gokuencinar.carrierfix
Name: CarrierFix (RootHide)
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64e
Description: Experimental Cricket/AT&T carrier overlay diagnostic and SMS/IMS repair tool for jailbroken iOS 15-17. Creates a backup before modifying the active carrier overlay and supports one-tap restore.
Maintainer: Gokuencinar
Author: Gokuencinar
Section: Tweaks
Depends: firmware (>= 15.0), firmware (<= 17.0)
